1. Flooding, China, Jun-Jul, $21.5 billion, 175 killed;

 2. Cyclone Amphan, India and Bangladesh, May 15-22, $13 billion, 118 killed;

 3. Flooding, Japan, Jul 3-10, $5 billion, 82 killed;

